
  REPLACE_TOOL — a CLI scaffolded from go_cli_tool_template

  USAGE

    REPLACE_TOOL [command] [--flags]

  COMMANDS

    check [files...]      Check that inputs are non-empty and valid UTF-8 (placeholder validation)
    completion [command]  Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell
    help [command]        Help about any command

  FLAGS

    --config              Path to a config file
    --debug               Raise log verbosity to debug (alias for --log-level debug)
    -h --help             Help for REPLACE_TOOL
    --log-format          Log format: auto, text, or json (auto)
    --log-level           Log verbosity: error, warn, info, or debug (warn)
    --no-color            Disable colored output
    --no-input            Never prompt; run non-interactively
    -o --output           Output format: text or json (text)
    -q --quiet            Suppress progress and non-error logs
    -v --verbose          Raise log verbosity to info (alias for --log-level info)
    --version             Version for REPLACE_TOOL

